15	// The utilities in this file help sanitize data from the user's arrow
16	// library into the types expected by vectordb's arrow library.  Node
17	// generally allows for mulitple versions of the same library (and sometimes
18	// even multiple copies of the same version) to be installed at the same
19	// time.  However, arrow-js uses instanceof which expected that the input
20	// comes from the exact same library instance.  This is not always the case
21	// and so we must sanitize the input to ensure that it is compatible.
